      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIGHTY ALAN (1) goes very well at the course with five wins and a placing from 12 starts. Comes off a (23.61) win last time, scoring by 4.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 411m at this track. Expected to go close. STEELY DAWN (4) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 23.67 beating Aston Tolhurst. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from four starts. Capable of going well again. TENEILLE (2) has been in super consistent form, finishing in the minors at her last five runs. Last start finished 3rd in a Grade 5 on August 17 over 411m at this track behind HIGHEST MOUSE beaten 1.5 lengths (23.79). Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Will give a great sight again. SHERRY NOT BERRY (7) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
